{
    "title": "Deliveroo: Food & Shopping",
    "description": "Your favourite takeaways and groceries, delivered to your door. Craving something delicious? With Deliveroo you can order takeaways and eat from food delivery favourites. Or take the eek out of the weekly shop with a grocery delivery from your favourite supermarkets. What's on the menu?\r\n\r\n\r\nOrder from the best local restaurants near you\r\n\r\nIn the mood for something special? Whether you\u2019re craving a burger, fried chicken or your taste buds are tingling for something new, everything is on the menu with this food app. Nothing beats a home delivery.\r\n\r\nFrom the nation\u2019s most-loved restaurant chains, to local legends and top takeaways, we\u2019ve got them all just waiting to be delivered to you, freshly prepared and ready to eat. From Chinese to Cuban, sushi takeaway to salads and pizza to Peruvian, there\u2019s a food delivery option for everyone on Deliveroo.\r\n\r\nReady to discover drool-worthy deals?\r\n\r\nServe up some exciting savings, feast your heart out with family-sized meal deals and discover our delicious discounts. With Deliveroo you can save BIG when you order from your favourite local restaurants, enjoy a fast food takeaway or get groceries delivered straight to your door.\r\n\r\nOrder your way\r\n\r\nWith Deliveroo it\u2019s easier than ever to order food delivery from restaurants near you. You can search in your area by:\r\n\u2022 Your favourite cuisine, dish or restaurant brand\r\n\u2022 Your dietary needs, whether that\u2019s vegan, gluten-free or anything else\r\n\u2022 The fastest delivery time, the top rated takeaway in your area and more\r\n\r\nYour convenience\r\n\r\nWe want to make it easier to get the food you love. You can:\r\n\u2022 Schedule your food delivery. Busy day? With Deliveroo you can schedule your food to arrive home at the same time as you, so that your food delivery is hot and ready to eat\r\n\u2022 Search for the latest takeaway deals and discounts in our \u201cOffers\u201d section\r\n\r\nTrack your food\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll know exactly where your food delivery is with our tracker, where you can:\r\n\u2022 Track the progress of your food and grocery delivery being made in real-time\r\n\u2022 Be alerted when your rider is on their way and close to you\r\n\u2022 Share your tracker with a group for larger orders\r\n\r\nEnjoy our offers\r\n\r\nDownload the app to browse our discounts:\r\n\u2022 Use your discount codes\r\n\u2022 View the latest takeaway deals in our \u201cOffers\u201d section\r\n\u2022 Filter grocery stores by offers available\r\n\r\nLoved by you, delivered by us\r\n\r\nJoin the millions of people who have already downloaded Deliveroo.\r\n\r\nGet your food or groceries delivered now or later. Whether you\u2019re in the mood for something special, your favourite curry or burger restaurant, or you fancy a small snack to eat or some cheeky fast food, download the Deliveroo app and we\u2019ll deliver straight to your door in minutes.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your favourite takeaways and groceries, delivered to your door. Craving something delicious? With Deliveroo you can order takeaways and eat from food delivery favourites. Or take the eek out of the weekly shop with a grocery delivery from your favourite supermarkets. What&#39;s on the menu?<br><br><br>Order from the best local restaurants near you<br><br>In the mood for something special? Whether you\u2019re craving a burger, fried chicken or your taste buds are tingling for something new, everything is on the menu with this food app. Nothing beats a home delivery.<br><br>From the nation\u2019s most-loved restaurant chains, to local legends and top takeaways, we\u2019ve got them all just waiting to be delivered to you, freshly prepared and ready to eat. From Chinese to Cuban, sushi takeaway to salads and pizza to Peruvian, there\u2019s a food delivery option for everyone on Deliveroo.<br><br>Ready to discover drool-worthy deals?<br><br>Serve up some exciting savings, feast your heart out with family-sized meal deals and discover our delicious discounts. With Deliveroo you can save BIG when you order from your favourite local restaurants, enjoy a fast food takeaway or get groceries delivered straight to your door.<br><br>Order your way<br><br>With Deliveroo it\u2019s easier than ever to order food delivery from restaurants near you. You can search in your area by:<br>\u2022 Your favourite cuisine, dish or restaurant brand<br>\u2022 Your dietary needs, whether that\u2019s vegan, gluten-free or anything else<br>\u2022 The fastest delivery time, the top rated takeaway in your area and more<br><br>Your convenience<br><br>We want to make it easier to get the food you love. You can:<br>\u2022 Schedule your food delivery. Busy day? With Deliveroo you can schedule your food to arrive home at the same time as you, so that your food delivery is hot and ready to eat<br>\u2022 Search for the latest takeaway deals and discounts in our \u201cOffers\u201d section<br><br>Track your food<br><br>You\u2019ll know exactly where your food delivery is with our tracker, where you can:<br>\u2022 Track the progress of your food and grocery delivery being made in real-time<br>\u2022 Be alerted when your rider is on their way and close to you<br>\u2022 Share your tracker with a group for larger orders<br><br>Enjoy our offers<br><br>Download the app to browse our discounts:<br>\u2022 Use your discount codes<br>\u2022 View the latest takeaway deals in our \u201cOffers\u201d section<br>\u2022 Filter grocery stores by offers available<br><br>Loved by you, delivered by us<br><br>Join the millions of people who have already downloaded Deliveroo.<br><br>Get your food or groceries delivered now or later. Whether you\u2019re in the mood for something special, your favourite curry or burger restaurant, or you fancy a small snack to eat or some cheeky fast food, download the Deliveroo app and we\u2019ll deliver straight to your door in minutes.",
